```tsquare
board "Files"
  screen desktop "File manager" chrome
    navbar "Files" leading=menu
    stack column padding=20 gap=12 grow
      table columns=[Name, Type, Size, Modified] rows=8
    drawer right "Details" size=280
      stack column padding=16 gap=12
        heading "filename.pdf" level=3
        text "Size: 2.4 MB" sm muted
        text "Modified: Oct 1, 2024" sm muted
        divider
        button secondary "Download" fullWidth
        button secondary "Share" fullWidth
        button secondary "Delete" fullWidth
```
